X
X                 PC LARN version 12.3 for IBM PC Compatibles
X                 -------------------------------------------
X
X
X     Table of contents
X     -----------------
X
X
X        1.  Introduction
X        2.  System requirements
X        3.  Files Supplied
X        4.  Installation
X        5.  Configuration
X        6.  Command line options
